From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:55:28 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Windows 10 Mobile: the renderer's main thread has 2 MB of
 stack

base gives a thread of a 32-bit process that is not under WOW64 512 KB,
while V8 on ARM takes its limit to be 864 KB below the stack's start: a
script that recurses until V8 would throw its RangeError ran off the end
of the real stack first, and in one process that ends the browser.
Reserved, not committed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc    | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
index a37324ca77eea80a7917881fdcf5f8bbcf397db7..3dfee1ad9950aa77a1ea554c73cd302aaaa73b06 100644
--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
+++ b/content/browser/renderer_host/render_process_host_impl.cc
@@ -2012,6 +2012,15 @@ bool RenderProcessHostImpl::Init() {
     // We can't have multiple UI loops on Linux and Android, so we don't support
     // in-process plugins.
     options.message_pump_type = base::MessagePumpType::DEFAULT;
+#endif
+#if defined(VENETIUM_W10M)
+    // Blink's main thread and V8's. base gives a thread of a 32-bit process
+    // that is not under WOW64 512 KB of stack (platform_thread_win.cc), while
+    // V8 on ARM takes its limit to be 864 KB below the stack's start
+    // (V8_DEFAULT_STACK_SIZE_KB): a script that recurses until V8 would throw
+    // its RangeError runs off the end of the real stack first, and that ends
+    // the whole browser. Reserved, not committed: address space only.
+    options.stack_size = 2 * 1024 * 1024;
 #endif
     // As for execution sequence, this callback should have no any dependency
     // on starting in-process-render-thread.
